X Server for Android, using SDL 1.2 backend.

You need to compile this code using SDL downloaded from

https://github.com/pelya/commandergenius

Compilation instructions:

https://github.com/pelya/commandergenius/tree/sdl_android/project/jni/application/xserver

To compile and run a test build of XSDL for Linux, run commands:

```
sudo apt-get install libsdl1.2-dev
sudo apt-get build-dep xserver-xorg-core
./build-xsdl-for-linux.sh
./start-linux.sh
```

Then you can run this command to test it:
```
export DISPLAY=:1111
xfwm4 &
xterm
```
